{"id":"393c7bf1c43bfbe3","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-cor-entropy-congruence.md","title":"Entropy Congruence","display":"cor-entropy-congruence — Entropy Congruence","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-entropy-congruence","aliases":["58-cor-entropy-congruence"],"display":"cor-entropy-congruence — Entropy Congruence","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-entropy-congruence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-entropy-congruence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-entropy-congruence — Entropy Congruence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8bad3810e4165411\" href=\"?note=8bad3810e4165411\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\Sigma_X,\\Sigma_Y,\\mu,\\nu,T,S,f,h_T,h_S\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\Sigma_X,\\Sigma_Y,\\mu,\\nu,T,S,f,h_T,h_S\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S(h_T,T,X,\\Sigma_X,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S(h_T,T,X,\\Sigma_X,\\mu)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S(h_S,S,Y,\\Sigma_Y,\\nu)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S(h_S,S,Y,\\Sigma_Y,\\nu)\\)</span> (Kolmogorov--Sinai entropy, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bad3810e4165411\" href=\"?note=8bad3810e4165411\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,X,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,X,Y)\\)</span> (bijection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}entropy\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S(h_T,T,X,\\Sigma_X,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S(h_S,S,Y,\\Sigma_Y,\\nu)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(A\\in\\Sigma_X\\leftrightarrow f[A]\\in\\Sigma_Y\\bigr)\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma_X\\;\\bigl(\\nu(f[A])=\\mu(A)\\bigr)\\land f\\circ T=S\\circ f\\Bigr)\\to h_T=h_S\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}entropy\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S(h_T,T,X,\\Sigma_X,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S(h_S,S,Y,\\Sigma_Y,\\nu)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(A\\in\\Sigma_X\\leftrightarrow f[A]\\in\\Sigma_Y\\bigr)\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma_X\\;\\bigl(\\nu(f[A])=\\mu(A)\\bigr)\\land f\\circ T=S\\circ f\\Bigr)\\to h_T=h_S\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The displayed hypotheses spell out a bimeasurable, measure-preserving conjugacy rather than reusing the unrelated first-order-structure isomorphism predicate.</li>\n<li>Kolmogorov--Sinai entropy is invariant under this measure-theoretic conjugacy.</li>\n<li>Ornstein's theorem gives the converse for two-sided Bernoulli shifts over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span> with finite entropy: equal entropy implies measure-theoretic isomorphism.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy.md","status":"resolved","id":"8bad3810e4165411","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy.md","status":"resolved","id":"8bad3810e4165411","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S(h_T,T,X,\\Sigma_X,\\mu)$ and $\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S(h_S,S,Y,\\Sigma_Y,\\nu)$ (Kolmogorov--Sinai entropy, see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,X,Y)$ (bijection predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,\\Sigma_X,\\Sigma_Y,\\mu,\\nu,T,S,f,h_T,h_S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S(h_T,T,X,\\Sigma_X,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S(h_S,S,Y,\\Sigma_Y,\\nu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}entropy\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S(h_T,T,X,\\Sigma_X,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S(h_S,S,Y,\\Sigma_Y,\\nu)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(A\\in\\Sigma_X\\leftrightarrow f[A]\\in\\Sigma_Y\\bigr)\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma_X\\;\\bigl(\\nu(f[A])=\\mu(A)\\bigr)\\land f\\circ T=S\\circ f\\Bigr)\\to h_T=h_S","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z","display":false}],"bytes":1624,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-cor-entropy-congruence.md|58-cor-entropy-congruence]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["8bad3810e4165411","d583890235faf0d5"]}